        "中間軸定理",
        "テニスラケットの定理",
        "線形安定性"
      ],
      "domain_tags": [
        "orbital_mechanics",
        "attitude_dynamics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "astro.att.n06_gravity_gradient_torque",
      "short_code": "AT06",
      "kind": "theorem_formula",
      "title": "中心重力場における重力傾度トルク",
      "summary": "軌道半径に比べ宇宙機寸法が十分小さいときの重力勾配に起因する復元・擾乱トルクの1次近似公式。",
      "canonical_latex": "\\mathbf{T}_{\\mathrm{gg}} = \\frac{3\\mu}{R_0^3}\\hat{\\mathbf{o}}_3 \\times (\\mathbf{I}\\hat{\\mathbf{o}}_3) = 3n^2\\hat{\\mathbf{o}}_3 \\times (\\mathbf{I}\\hat{\\mathbf{o}}_3)\\quad \\left(n = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mu}{R_0^3}}\\right)",
      "aliases_latex": [
